  "description": "The VooPoo Vmate E2 Pod Kit is an elegant yet powerful vaping device designed to offer a versatile and convenient vaping experience. With a built-in 1500mAh battery and a maximum output of 30W, the Vmate E2 provides consistent, satisfying performance for both MTL (Mouth-to-Lung) and RDL (Restricted Direct Lung) vaping styles. Equipped with stepless adjustable airflow, the Vmate E2 allows users to fine-tune their draw to suit their preferences. The device also features intelligent power matching, automatically adjusting output to optimise performance based on the resistance of the installed pod. The included 2ml top-fill pods make refilling quick and mess-free. The kit comes with two pod options: a 0.4Ω pod for a richer, direct-lung inhale and a 0.7Ω pod for a smooth restricted-lung draw, both delivering incredible flavour and vapour production. Stylishly crafted from durable zinc alloy and featuring a dual-sided leather design, the Vmate E2 is as elegant as it is practical. A magnetic dust cap protects the mouthpiece, while the OLED display provides real-time updates on battery life and usage. USB Type-C fast charging ensures the device is ready to go when you are. Whether you’re a new vaper or an experienced enthusiast, the VooPoo Vmate E2 Pod Kit delivers flexibility, convenience, and style in one compact device. Browse our vape juice and choose the ideal match for this kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
